{"id":"vod_hh_67921","vodId":"67921","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"鬼神童子","name_cn":"鬼神童子","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第51集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/fd00756a9a5295413342790f2cd6bae9.jpg"},"summary":"很久很久以前，人世间鬼怪横行，魑魅魍魉泛滥成灾。当时出现了一个最强的役小角，他降服了拥有强大实力的鬼神为自己所用，以铲除为非作歹的鬼怪。在役小角临死之际，他将鬼神封印，人世间绝少听闻鬼神的消息。时间来到了现代，役小角的后代小明（横山智佐 饰）在命运的驱使下解开封印，可是 高傲的前鬼根本不服从小明的役使，于是这个女孩只得将其变成童子的模样。与此同时，凭依兽大量出现，而许多可怕的敌人交替登场。人世间再度为难，小明能否继承祖先的遗志，和前鬼共同击退各路邪祟呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-07-20 13:54:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aK2P0Re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejkEyRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepqNG6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejkEy5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwAXXRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6vngnb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aM2RRAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZok3Ja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepqNG2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8xppmb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVk481a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbD2GMne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelmJj6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penoLMla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelmJjla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZo3Ova/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aM2RY3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuu